{#- Leapvoy default email template (v1). Fixed text stays as-is. AI fills only: opening_line, fit_bullets, closing_line. -#}
Subject: {{ subject_override or ("Application for " ~ role ~ " - " ~ profile.full_name ~ (subject_extras or "")) }}

Dear {{ hr_first_name or "Hiring Team" }},

I am writing to apply for the {{ role }} role at {{ company | trim | trim(".") }}. {{ opening_line }}

Why I am a strong fit:

{% for b in fit_bullets -%}
- {{ b.label }}: {{ b.proof }}
{% endfor %}
{{ closing_line }}

GitHub: {{ profile.github_url }}
LinkedIn: {{ profile.linkedin_url }}

I have attached my resume and look forward to hearing from you.

Best regards,
{{ profile.full_name }}
{{ profile.phone }}
